	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[M.U.L.E. Player's Guide]]></title>
		<link>https://fujinet.online/mule-players-guide/</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[fujinet]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://fujinet.online/mule-players-guide/</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><em>The player's guide to The FujiNet Multiplayer M.U.L.E., in an edition for each machine it runs on.</em></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>M.U.L.E. is played over the Internet with FujiNet. Up to four colonists share a room. Right now there is one room, <strong>Planet IRATA</strong>, and more will be added. Each guide below covers the same game, with its own machine's pictures, controls and loading steps.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:list -->
<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><a href="/mule-players-guide/mule-players-guide-atari/">Atari 8-bit</a> (Atari 400, 800, XL and XE computers)</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><a href="/mule-players-guide/mule-players-guide-apple2/">Apple II</a> (Apple //e (enhanced, 128K), //c and IIgs)</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><a href="/mule-players-guide/mule-players-guide-coco/">Color Computer</a> (TRS-80 Color Computer 1 and 2)</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><a href="/mule-players-guide/mule-players-guide-msdos/">MS-DOS</a> (IBM PC (CGA) and IBM PCjr)</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><a href="/mule-players-guide/mule-players-guide-adam/">Coleco Adam</a> (Coleco Adam)</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><a href="/mule-players-guide/mule-players-guide-msx/">MSX</a> (MSX1, MSX2 and later)</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><a href="/mule-players-guide/mule-players-guide-lynx/">Atari Lynx</a> (Atari Lynx)</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><a href="/mule-players-guide/mule-players-guide-intv/">Intellivision</a> (Mattel Intellivision)</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><a href="/mule-players-guide/mule-players-guide-astrocade/">Bally Astrocade</a> (Bally Professional Arcade / Astrocade)</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><a href="/mule-players-guide/mule-players-guide-atari-2600/">Atari 2600</a> (Atari 2600 VCS)</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->]]></content:encoded>
